s://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982719_567560932402810_3955407672148257953_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=RvVH3lZD7igQ7kNvwFzNrB6&_nc_oc=AdpAGqqrOus5kCCHtG6lFWx86LAXH6rQrq9KBIqcV0woWDkOB8K-cl-CiuKkttBa9H4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQElHp6nb8PReWNwsw0B2f5ldMMJll2el3QNexZUmeaCTQ&oe=6A82E6F6"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot-5.png", "id": "539248228620280", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75507166_539248235286946_3185699325442215788_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=P9nKGwLINf4Q7kNvwG9weRx&_nc_oc=AdqSY-uaRIG_WOsdvgi5bnuvCS-8RwMiM9bUZD6E0OLo3jKppEmLsjBdlmoL_Jk1LaM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE3Rt1oODRNyOnwLHEgxUsmp4RKpCUWgwepQEBarPpQ4w&oe=6A82EB9F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Breathe-Cover-Art-Landscape-V4.png", "id": "1436022740419579", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566677_1436022743752912_6950349708691337961_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6mcgQLRtiF4Q7kNvwGID0B9&_nc_oc=AdpIQTAOwKogWNVRcgRmidbxYsM9_jEqT05TRp2v9VqPnZZCpxhjAPfu8EiBNxogFo4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFcP3kan1qf3jjzWxMhlqQbYXuX4ELlT18SfSC-tsKvnw&oe=6A82ED86"}, "display_name": "Breathe by Reflexion | Flo2Plus", "keywords": ["Breathing", "Meditation", "Stress", "Fitness", "Mindfulness"], "long_description": "# Experience a 20-Day Journey to Reduce Stress and Find Calm with Breathe.\n\nTransform your stress in just 20 days with guided breathwork. Each day, you'll learn to shift from shallow breathing that heightens stress to deep, calming breathing that foster relaxation and resilience. By optimizing your 20,000 daily breaths, you can enhance both your mental and physical well-being.\n\n## **How It Works**\n1. **Begin with a Quick Lesson**: Start each day with a brief insight on breathing and stress management.\n2. **Choose Your Session**: Select a 5-minute guided breathwork session.\n3. **Practice Daily**: Carry these techniques with you, and return the next day to continue your journey\n\n## **Guided Sessions**   \n\nJoin breathwork expert Michael Watts and Lumi, a guiding light that breathes with you. Choose a 5-minute session that fits your day\u2014morning, midday, or evening. Each session is crafted to help you breathe deeply, reset, and build resilience.\n\n## **The Science of Breath**\n\nBreathwork is more than a trend\u2014it\u2019s a scientifically supported practice that can reduce mental health issues and improve well-being. By changing your breathing patterns, you influence your body\u2019s response to stress, helping you feel more centered and in control.\n\n## **Innovative Breath Tracking**\n\nReflexion\u2019s advanced breath tracking offers real-time personalized feedback to help you refine your practice. See your breath visualized as a gentle cloud, making each session more engaging and meaningful.\n\nSee you in there.", "short_description": "Transform your stress in 20 days with a guided breathwork journey brought to you by Reflexion and Flo2Plus. Each day, learn how to shift from fast, shallow breathing that heightens stress to slow, deep breaths that cultivate relaxation and resilience. With over 20,000 breaths each day, every inhale and exhale becomes a chance to improve your mental and physical well-being. Discover the powerful connection between how you breathe and how you feel."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://reflexion.co/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://reflexion.co/reflexions-end-user-license-agreement/", "publisher_name": "Reflexion Interactive Technologies, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://reflexion.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": 